<title>AUSTRALIA: Mayne shares up after Optus control change.</title>
<headline>Mayne shares up after Optus control change.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in transport and healthcare group Mayne Nickless Ltd rose over four percent at WeDnesday's opening following news of the change in shareholding at its 24.9 percent owned Optus Communications Pty Ltd.</p>
<p>At 10.10 a.m. (0010 GMT), Mayne Nickless shares were 33 cents or 4.27 percent higher at A$8.05, with over 460,000 shares traded.</p>
</text>
